{"page":561,"verses":[{"verse_key":"66:8","surah":66,"ayah":8,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ تُوبُوٓا۟ إِلَى ٱللَّهِ تَوْبَةً نَّصُوحًا عَسَىٰ رَبُّكُمْ أَن يُكَفِّرَ عَنكُمْ سَيِّـَٔاتِكُمْ وَيُدْخِلَكُمْ جَنَّـٰتٍ تَجْرِى مِن تَحْتِهَا ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ يَوْمَ لَا يُخْزِى ٱللَّهُ ٱلنَّبِىَّ وَٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ مَعَهُۥ ۖ نُورُهُمْ يَسْعَىٰ بَيْنَ أَيْدِيهِمْ وَبِأَيْمَـٰنِهِمْ يَقُولُونَ رَبَّنَآ أَتْمِمْ لَنَا نُورَنَا وَٱغْفِرْ لَنَآ ۖ إِنَّكَ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ قَدِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Believers, turn to God in sincere repentance. Your Lord may well cancel your bad deeds for you and admit you into Gardens graced with flowing streams, on a Day when God will not disgrace the Prophet or those who have believed with him. With their lights streaming out ahead of them and to their right, they will say, ‘Lord, perfect our lights for us and forgive us: You have power over everything.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"66:8"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(you) who believe","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"66:8"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"66:8"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تُوبُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"Turn","transliteration":"tūbū","verse_key":"66:8"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"66:8"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"66:8"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تَوْبَةًۭ","en_gloss":"(in) repentance","transliteration":"tawbatan","verse_key":"66:8"},{"pos":8,"ar":"نَّصُوحًا","en_gloss":"sincere","transliteration":"naṣūḥan","verse_key":"66:8"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَسَىٰ","en_gloss":"Perhaps","transliteration":"ʿasā","verse_key":"66:8"},{"pos":10,"ar":"رَبُّكُمْ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbukum","verse_key":"66:8"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"will","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"66:8"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يُكَفِّرَ","en_gloss":